  "details": "I am now unable to launch multiple local clients though the Unity launcher, on newer and older SDKs, using \"Build & Test\" :\n\n- If I use the live version of VRChat, the second client freezes while loading in the world, or doesn't \"download\" it (download stuck at 0%), \n\n- If I use the beta version, the second client throws an EAC error (\"you are in offline testing mode and cannot travel to online worlds\").\n\nI now need to use the VRC Quick launcher (first screenshot) from VCC, the second instance needs to have a different profile ID",
